# UI, Styling & Primitive System

- DO NOT use plain `StyleSheet.create` in components — use `makeStyles` in `${componentName}.styles.ts`.
- ALWAYS use `MakeStylesProps` from `@/hooks/theme/useMakeStyles`; destructure `theme` param; no hardcoded colors, padding, or font sizes.
- ALWAYS use `fonts` from theme params; add missing sizes to `src/styles/fonts.ts`.
- ALWAYS use `TextView` and `PressableView` primitives — never `Text`, `Button`, `TouchableOpacity`.
- NEVER hardcode text — use `localize` from `useAppLocalization`; add keys to relevant `src/localization/locals/` domain file.
- NEVER pass `cond && style` to `StyleSheet.flatten` — use `flattenStyle` from `src/utils/styles/flattenStyle.ts`.
- No external UI libraries.
